## 12. Testing the extension

**Unit (mocha + sinon, no VS Code host):** intent parser table tests; engine transition matrix incl. every triage class routing to the right state; session schema round-trip and migration; `execConfig` detection and validation (including rejecting `-DskipTests` as a clean-build command); Maven/Gradle/npm error extractors against log fixtures; redactor (multi-secret, overlapping, partial-line, exception message); `paths.assertInsideRepo` against `..`, absolute, and symlink escapes.

**Git integration (temp dirs, real `git`, bare origin):** dirty-tree abort/stash/discard-with-phrase; base sync + branch cut; existing-branch reuse/rename; shallow-clone warning; conflict and auth error classification; push retry only on transient.

**Extension integration (`@vscode/test-electron`, fixture Maven app with a real `/actuator/health`):** stub `LanguageModelChat` returning canned plan + tool calls; drive S1→S23 and assert branch, files, commit, verified health, artifacts, secrets deleted. Resume test: kill the host at S12 and re-activate.

**Regression stage (fixture `fake-runner` Express app):** happy path; selector miss → manual handoff → continue; download parse for `.json`/`.csv`/`.zip`; failed-counts path → `DESIGN_DEFECT` → replan.

**Manual acceptance:** cancel mid-build; wrong password; runner requiring MFA; no remote configured; no actuator present; `git reset` refused on dirty tree.

